{
  "id": "professor-cup",
  "name": "Professor Cup",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Professor Cups are fun-format tournaments held through the year for Pokémon Professors, usually those at Stage 1 and above. Their promo, stamped with the Professor Program logo, came in regular and Staff versions, with Top 8 and Champion copies for the best finishers. Stamped placement cards were first given at Professor Cup Stuttgart in December 2022, on Friends in Galar; Friends in Hisui and Friends in Sinnoh followed.\n\nCommunity Center, a cosmos reverse holo, became the promo at the Cup held during Professor Conference 2024 in Mexico City and was the first with a Top 4 stamp, in five versions. Friends in Paldea replaced it from the 2025-26 season, which also brought a Finalist stamp for the runner-up in each game: the card game, Pokémon GO and the video game.",
